 "notes": "Dropped/moved: Kolhapuri and Peshawari chappals (old Flat strap sandal models) live in Traditional footwear (shelf 06_00, own kinds); Birkenstock Boston is a clog (Clog kind, other shelf). Arizona and Madrid moved from Flat strap sandal to Slide (backless); Gizeh placed under Flip-flop. 'Other heeled sandals' dissolved into Heeled sandal types; its Wörishofer moved to Wedge sandal as an archetype. Trimmed SKU lists: dropped Teva Hydratrek, Grandview Max; Chaco Rapid Pro; Keen Hyperport H2; Hoka Infini Hike TC; Pikolinos Tarifa. Left out for lack of a retrievable source: Ancient Greek Sandals brand/archetype (pages 403), Havaianas Top date (sources conflict 1969/1994), Teva 1984 model name beyond Deckers' 'Original Sandal'. Wedge kind source changed from Old Navy to Wikipedia. Parallel fetch unavailable (402), wiki tool rate-limited (429)."
